        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Duh thangc agay-gipui chamv anu khou chu guang pwkhou,",
            "Kandih paap >|3 kabamv ’thuic zynmei ta ai thay e,",
            "Lwmsiimei, pingmei lev kandih puat >|3 ata khanv e,",
            "Beulah ramc khou >|3 ata ’thiam pat lak.",
            "",
            "Ai lungc bam kauhmei chyng khou,",
            "Muangh maekmei tingpuk bangc khou,",
            "Puak taek lakmei duipuak dui",
            "Zangvna ai ringc bam e,",
            "Gat dat zat lakmei Tingkauh Manna",
            "Tuna ai hei lungc bam e,",
            "Beulah ramc khou ai lunghpui paan >|3.",
            "",
            "2 Pwanzingh aliu bam kan diu, ata tiiping ngam mak khe,",
            "Ravguangc baanc >|3 gaeklouna ai kabiu dat lak khe;",
            "Hei khou hei neihmik key dat lak, siimei >|3 namv lak khe,",
            "Tingsaeng khang ai duak the, Beulah ramc khou.",
            "",
            "3 Beulah ramc khou Ravguangc taanv ta ai phaanna chak pwkhou,",
            "Achaenglwan guay Kamei >|3 chamdaanvloumei thay e;",
            "Khou hei Bumaengh khou lungcnapadikmei ringcbamv thay the,",
            "Neihlaana lungc bam ni, Beulah ramc khou."
          ]
        }
      },
